{
    "background_story": "Aziel was a brilliant and eccentric artist who lived in a world of her own creation. She was known for her vivid paintings that transported viewers to a fantastical realm, which she called 'Wonderland'. Inspired by the surreal landscapes of her dreams, Aziel's art studio became a portal to this mystical world. As she worked, her imagination would run wild, conjuring up fantastical creatures and landscapes that seemed to spring to life from her canvases. People would whisper that Aziel's Wonderland was a real place, hidden just beyond the edge of reality, and that those who gazed upon her art would catch glimpses of its magic. Aziel's art studio became a magnet for those seeking inspiration and a taste of the extraordinary. Her Wonderland had become a beacon, drawing kindred spirits into its fantastical realm.",
